+
+      <div style="height:20px"></div>
+      <h2 style="font-size:1.8rem; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:18px;">Why Choose a Private Transfer for a Long Journey</h2>
+      <p style="color:var(--gray); margin-bottom:18px;">Three hours is a long time on a coast road, and a private car means one fixed price for the whole vehicle, whether you are travelling alone or as a group of up to eight, plus a driver dedicated to your journey from the moment you land. Child seats are free on request.</p>
+      <ul class="trip-highlights" style="margin-bottom:32px;">
+        <li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>No shared shuttle, direct to your address</li>
