+
+      <h2 style="font-size:1.8rem; text-transform:uppercase; margin-bottom:18px;">Fixed, All-Inclusive Pricing</h2>
+      <p style="color:var(--gray); margin-bottom:18px;">The price is agreed before you set off. It is based on the real route distance and the vehicle class rather than a taxi meter, and it already includes tolls, fuel and the meet and greet. There is nothing extra to settle once you arrive, and the driver's journey to the airport is never added to your price.</p>
